<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Integrations — Classic Academy</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

  <meta name="description" content="Tools Classic Academy connects with: email delivery, media storage, Google Workspace, and QR-based verification." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-snippet:-1,max-image-preview:large,max-video-preview:-1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4a90e2" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.classicacademy.app/integrations" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Integrations — Classic Academy" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Tools Classic Academy connects with." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/integrations" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/img/hero.png" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Integrations — Classic Academy" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Tools Classic Academy connects with." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.classicacademy.app/img/hero.png" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700&family=Outfit:wght@100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style nonce="<%= cspNonce %>">
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root { --primary: #4a90e2; --accent: #d97800; --highlight: #009f8b; --ink: #0f172a; --muted: #475569; --page-pad: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 6rem); --shadow2: 0 18px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, .12); }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; background: #e0f7fa; color: #333; overflow-x: clip; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; padding-top: 112px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { body { padding-top: 102px; } }
    #loader { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: #e0f7fa; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 9999; padding: 1.2rem; text-align: center; }
    .academylogo { width: min(220px, 70vw); }
    .academylogo img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .loader { position: relative; width: 18px; height: 28px; perspective: 500px; animation: flip 2s infinite; }
    .loader:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; } .loader:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; } .loader:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.6s; } .loader:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.8s; }
    .face { position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; backface-visibility: hidden; border-radius: 4px; }
    .front { background: var(--primary); } .back { background: #d35400; transform: rotateY(180deg); }
    @keyframes flip { 0%, 100% { transform: rotateY(0deg); } 50% { transform: rotateY(180deg); } }
    .header { position: fixed; top: 14px; left: var(--page-pad); right: var(--page-pad); padding: .65rem .85rem; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .70); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); box-shadow: 0 16px 46px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: .8rem; z-index: 2000; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; min-width: 0; color: var(--ink); }
    .brand-mark { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 14px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .10); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .85); flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .brand-txt { display: grid; line-height: 1.05; min-width: 0; }
    .brand-name { font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .brand-sub { font-size: .86rem; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .navbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; }
    .navbar a { padding: .55rem .75rem; border-radius: 999px; color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.02rem; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease, color .2s ease; white-space: nowrap; }
    .navbar a:hover { background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .10); transform: translateY(-1px); color: var(--ink); }
    .nav-pill { border: 1px solid rgba(74, 144, 226, .35); background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .10); color: #0f172a !important; font-weight: 800; }
    .nav-pill:hover { background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .18); border-color: rgba(74, 144, 226, .45); }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; flex: 0 0 auto; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .45rem; padding: 0.72rem 1rem; background-color: var(--primary); color: white; border: 1px solid var(--primary); border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 800; transition: background-color .25s ease, transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(74, 144, 226, .18); white-space: nowrap; }
    .btn:hover { background-color: transparent; color: var(--primary); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(15, 23, 42, .12); }
    .btn.ghost { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72); border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .12); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08); }
    .btn-sm { padding: .55rem .8rem !important; font-size: .95rem !important; box-shadow: none !important; }
    .menu-btn { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, .12); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08); }
    .menu-btn i { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.05rem; }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .brand-sub { display: none; } .menu-btn { display: inline-flex; }
      .navbar { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + .65rem); left: 0; right: 0; margin: 0 .25rem; padding: .75rem; background: rgba(74, 144, 226, .96); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .35); border-radius: 20px; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); display: grid; gap: .4rem; transform: translateY(-8px); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease; }
      .navbar.active { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
      .navbar a { color: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: .85rem .85rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); }
      .navbar a:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14); transform: none; color: #fff; }
      .nav-pill { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .18); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .35); color: #fff !important; }
    }
    .about-hero { margin: 0 var(--page-pad); border-radius: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .28); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .55); box-shadow: var(--shadow2); padding: 2rem 2rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr .9fr; gap: 1.8rem; align-items: center; }
    .about-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.12; margin-top: .6rem; }
    .about-hero p { margin-top: .65rem; color: #475569; max-width: 58ch; }
    .about-hero .kicker { display: inline-flex; gap: .55rem; align-items: center; padding: .45rem .8rem; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .75); color: #1f2a44; font-weight: 700; font-size: .95rem; }
    .about-hero .actions { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.1rem; }
    .about-hero .media { border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .55); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .75); box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10); }
    .about-hero .media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .page-wrap { margin: 0 var(--page-pad); padding: 2.2rem 0 2.8rem 0; }
    .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.1rem; }
    .cardx { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .70); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .85); border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, .10); padding: 1.2rem 1.15rem; }
    .cardx h3 { margin: 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; gap: .55rem; align-items: center; }
    .cardx h3 i { color: var(--primary); }
    .cardx p { margin-top: .6rem; color: #475569; }
    .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; padding: .25rem .65rem; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(22,163,74,.12); color: #15803d; font-weight: 800; font-size: .78rem; margin-top: .7rem; }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) { .about-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 1.25rem; } .about-hero h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; } .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.95rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-radius: 25px; margin: 2rem var(--page-pad); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); gap: 0; }
    .footer div { margin: 1rem; flex: 1 1 220px; min-width: 220px; }
    .footer h4 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .footer ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .footer ul li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .footer ul li a { color: #333; }
    .footer ul li a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    #toTopBtn { position: fixed; bottom: 30px; right: 30px; background-color: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); display: none; z-index: 1000; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
    #toTopBtn:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }
    .fab-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; position: fixed; bottom: 170px; right: 20px; z-index: 999; }
    .fab-container:hover { height: 100%; }
    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(2) { transform: translateY(-80px); }
    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-140px); }
    .fab-container:hover .sub-button:nth-child(4) { transform: translateY(-200px); }
    .fab-container .sub-button { position: absolute; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; bottom: 10px; right: 10px; height: 50px; width: 50px; background-color: #4ba2ff; border-radius: 50%; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
    .fab-container .fab { position: relative; height: 70px; width: 70px; background-color: #4ba2ff; border-radius: 50%; z-index: 2; }
    .fab-container .fab:before { content: " "; position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; height: 35px; width: 35px; background-color: inherit; border-radius: 0 0 10px 0; z-index: -1; }
    .fab-container .fab .fab-content { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; width: 100%; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
    .fab-container .fab .fab-content .material-icons { color: #2e2e2e; font-size: 48px; }
    .fab-container .sub-button .material-icons { color: #2e2e2e; padding-top: 6px; }
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/classic-motion.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div id="loader">
    <div class="academylogo"><img src="./img/academylogo.png" alt="Classic Academy logo"></div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:10px;">
      <div class="loader"><div class="face front"></div><div class="face back"></div></div>
      <div class="loader"><div class="face front"></div><div class="face back"></div></div>
      <div class="loader"><div class="face front"></div><div class="face back"></div></div>
      <div class="loader"><div class="face front"></div><div class="face back"></div></div>
      <div class="loader"><div class="face front"></div><div class="face back"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="header" id="siteHeader">
    <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="Classic Academy Home">
      <img class="brand-mark" src="./img/academylogo.png" alt="Classic Academy logo">
      <div class="brand-txt"><span class="brand-name">Classic Academy</span><span class="brand-sub">School management + admissions</span></div>
    </a>
    <nav class="navbar" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/services">Features</a>
      <a href="/#testimonials">Benefits</a>
      <a href="/#contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="/#pricing">Join Today</a>
      <a class="nav-pill" href="/schedule">Sign In</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn btn-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Book Demo</a>
      <button id="menu-btn" class="menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i></button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="about-hero reveal">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker"><i class="fa-solid fa-plug"></i> Integrations</span>
      <h1>Works with the tools schools already use</h1>
      <p>Classic Academy connects with a handful of well-established services rather than reinventing email,
        storage, or document scanning.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/contact"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Ask about a specific tool</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/docs"><i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i> Documentation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="media"><img src="img/hero.png" alt=""></div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-wrap">
    <div class="grid-3 reveal">
      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text"></i> Email delivery</h3>
        <p>Transactional email (invites, password resets, notices) is delivered through a standard SMTP provider —
          no separate email account juggling for staff.</p>
        <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Active</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i> Media storage</h3>
        <p>Photos and documents (student photos, logos, attachments) are stored and optimized through Cloudinary so
          pages load quickly regardless of file size.</p>
        <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Active</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i> Google Workspace</h3>
        <p>Where a school connects it, Google account data can be used for calendar and directory style workflows
          via the Google APIs.</p>
        <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Active</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode"></i> QR verification</h3>
        <p>Transcripts and ID documents can carry a QR code that links back to a verification page, so anyone can
          confirm a document is genuine.</p>
        <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Active</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-file-csv"></i> CSV import/export</h3>
        <p>Bring existing student, staff, and finance records in via CSV, and export reports the same way — no
          lock-in to a proprietary format.</p>
        <span class="pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Active</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cardx">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Something missing?</h3>
        <p>If your school relies on a specific tool we don't yet support, <a href="/contact">tell us</a> — we
          prioritize integrations based on what schools actually ask for.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include("../partials/footer") %>

  <button id="toTopBtn" aria-label="Scroll to top">↑</button>

  <div class="fab-container" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="fab shadow"><div class="fab-content"><span class="material-icons">support_agent</span></div></div>
    <div class="sub-button shadow"><a href="tel:+256781977217"><span class="material-icons">phone</span></a></div>
    <div class="sub-button shadow"><a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=256781977217" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i></a></div>
    <div class="sub-button shadow"><a href="/share" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="material-icons">share</span></a></div>
  </div>

  <script src="/pages/terms.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/classic-motion.js" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
